  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Women: Generating evidence and catalysing climate action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will aim to achieve its goal by generating a body of robust, policy-relevant knowledge on gender equality and climate to support gender-responsive policymaking and climate negotiations; and ensuring that knowledge on gender equality and climate change is accessible by policy actors and advocates, who have increased capacity to use it to inform gender-responsive policymaking, climate negotiations, advocacy efforts and accountability.</narrative>
  </description>
